[{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/celery/celery/issues/comments/432791839","html_url":"https://github.com/celery/celery/issues/5144#issuecomment-432791839","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/celery/celery/issues/5144","id":432791839,"node_id":"MDEyOklzc3VlQ29tbWVudDQzMjc5MTgzOQ==","user":{"login":"sihrc","id":3360831,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjMzNjA4MzE=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/3360831?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/sihrc","html_url":"https://github.com/sihrc","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sihrc/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sihrc/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sihrc/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sihrc/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sihrc/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sihrc/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sihrc/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sihrc/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sihrc/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2018-10-24T19:12:57Z","updated_at":"2018-10-24T19:12:57Z","body":"I've done some more debugging and found that `context` becomes a string here. Msgpack serializes my return value as bytes, but somewhere along the way to the logger, the bytes seem to be cast to a string It looks something like `\"b'.. bytes...'\"` \r\n\r\nAt the moment, I'm working around this by patching the `info` method in `celery/app/trace.py` with the following:\r\n```python3\r\ndef info(fmt, context):\r\n    \"\"\"Log 'fmt % context' with severity 'INFO'.\r\n\r\n    'context' is also passed in extra with key 'data' for custom handlers.\r\n    \"\"\"\r\n    if isinstance(context[\"return_value\"], str):\r\n        context_copy = copy.deepcopy(context)\r\n        context_copy[\"return_value\"] = context_copy[\"return_value\"].encode(\"utf-8\")\r\n        return orig_info(fmt, context_copy)\r\n    return orig_info(fmt, context)\r\n```\r\n\r\nThere must be a way to resolve this issue that I am unaware of. I would love guidance on where I should look. Thank you!\r\n\r\n","author_association":"NONE","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/celery/celery/issues/comments/432791839/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"event":"commented","actor":{"login":"sihrc","id":3360831,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjMzNjA4MzE=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/3360831?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/sihrc","html_url":"https://github.com/sihrc","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sihrc/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sihrc/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sihrc/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sihrc/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sihrc/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sihrc/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sihrc/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sihrc/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sihrc/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false}},{"id":2332151687,"node_id":"MDE1Ok1pbGVzdG9uZWRFdmVudDIzMzIxNTE2ODc=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/celery/celery/issues/events/2332151687","actor":{"login":"auvipy","id":6212603,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjYyMTI2MDM=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/6212603?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/auvipy","html_url":"https://github.com/auvipy","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/auvipy/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/auvipy/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https: